    <description>SlimeSS — Screenshot &amp; screen recording made simple.

Capture fullscreen, active window, custom region, and all running windows (grid collage).
Record screen, windows, fixed apps, or directly to GIF. Multi-monitor auto-follow,
customizable hotkeys, files auto-organized by month/year. Free 7-day trial with full features.</description>
